Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato's current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And our next warp will take us out of the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,41 kiloparsecs separate our galaxy and the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we still have 130,000 light years of unknown space ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're beyond the Milky Way,\Nour enemy will stop pursuing us so closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When you consider the conditions required for civilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, the number of available systems,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it's likely the Garmillas System exists within our own galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it'll be good to have the Garmillans off our backs for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so relaxed... You amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that you shouldn't be taking it so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I'm taking it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being stupidly idealistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Melda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a Garmillan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you believe what she said, don't you? That we fired first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you basically said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blood pressure's a little high.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The young ones lose their tempers easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to control yourself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You always know what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"You lack the self-awareness required of an officer."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what they do to punish elementary school children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this up and hit the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're offering a limited-time Milky Way lunch in the cafeteria. Want to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you told Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's what had him so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you regret it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he was Captain Daigo Shima's son. He'll accept the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think so? People in high positions can be surprisingly fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. It's a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome. Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His Lordship is using the hotline right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The hotline?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd gone back to your old tricks out of pity for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my country's heart and soul. Naturally, I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace in the universe is only possible because of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'd like to speak to you in person. We'll talk again some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you two here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparations for Senior General Domel's medal ceremony have been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. What about you, Gimleh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to report the secret police's latest findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.31,0:06:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding the rogue elements within the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall leave this to you. Handle it in any way you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the Terron ship, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the end of their journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears we've found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Domel!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Domel! Ghale Domel!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Domel! Ghale Domel!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Phuzeron!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're perhaps wondering why\NI've recalled you from the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Small Magellanic Cloud is the lynchpin of our defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The absence of a commanding officer aids the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There has been a problem within the Milky Way Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard the rumors. A Terron ship broke through our dragnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Schultz fell in battle against them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like for you to take care of this barbarian ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is your order. I am a soldier, loyal to you and to the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah to the shining star of Garmillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A promotion to High Chief General?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What concerns me is your popularity among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:09:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Be wary. Many of those who surround\NHis Lordship do not think well of your rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Goer, your new direct superior,\Nis one of Sideburns Zoellik's lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Baleras has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was glad to hear your Melda was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter is very inconsiderate. She refuses to share any details.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that, Elk? Even the fierce Admiral Ditz has a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Talan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a request, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you lend me that specialized operations ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Guard checkpoint. Your identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabotage at the Floating Plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebel forces we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like ordinary citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Gimleh has ordered that they all be sent to the prison planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pass through. Ghale Desler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right. Baleras has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be let out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What we discussed earlier... I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? The Leader's permission is required to use that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Supreme Commander of Astrofleets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend I never asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Marshal continues to expand our territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Jirel witch spreads his propaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vice-Commander is a figurehead, the Guard's arrogance is astonishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and our leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...plans to move the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To move the capital? To move Baleras?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A great unification.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have we come from, and where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing the philosopher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you remembered this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,At our Leader's bequest, I've temporarily returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a rokrhok bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were alive, they'd be that age now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What did our leader want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered me to command the Milky Way Theatre's armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way is far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So very far...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, we shall be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay there and watch, as the wolf I've released catches its prey in its jaws...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They survived, but it appears they suffer from amnesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumors say it was terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Auto-navigation system, all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Have a weird dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Uh, a dream about a beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If she was beautiful, it was a good dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, no, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too, Hayashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it was a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The auto-navigation room, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked just like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Overwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But they say that the room's haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if there were a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that kind of ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.87,0:15:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And she was naked...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't remove her clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being stupid, drink this, and go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tranquilizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked just like Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he should be heading to Niimi instead of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finished cleaning the patient room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ensign Yamamoto, you are now released from the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was a rough six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything else stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost a valuable ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your safety is more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You finished your punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, everything's shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were playing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it helps me relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think I'd be able to pilot this like Yamamoto does?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "nope"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here because of her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:16:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to believe it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my family to their attacks, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And my brother died in battle.\NNever knowing he was just a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look like that. I've settled things in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'll just trust Captain Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But he isn't like me. He has family to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In that sense, I'm a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on this ship is your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a mother and a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My eldest has a wife and child, and then I've another son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My second son says he wants to be a sailor like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A sailor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that there are any ships left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't it nice anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm more interested in my grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very cute. I can't die until I find her a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't be easy to find someone who meets your standards...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Why don't you marry her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko's going to grow up to be a very beautiful lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can have her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes there's more than one truth.\NYou have your truth, and they have theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is only one reality. The war really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you and I have our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are blessed. Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai Susumu, coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. This is the final room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent timing. I was just thinking I wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you holding a mop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I suppose the same thing that happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I disobeyed orders, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I opposed the surprise attack, and I was removed from duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.91,0:20:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I disobeyed an order. That isn't what a soldier should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are times even a soldier should act like a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,People make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You need the courage to disobey an order you believe is wrong, to remain true to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.61,0:20:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you wished to avenge your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, the enemy saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you stayed true to your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kodai was too idealistic when he said we and Melda could understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I understand a little now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father isn't going to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can be friends with the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.97,0:21:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's our enemy. Don't you hate her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel hatred anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hold on to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I had time to cool my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go cool my own head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are they running that limited-time lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next week, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit on our port side! A torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.37,0:25:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato hides, wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The eyes of a hunter search for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.21,0:25:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow of an invisible enemy, sharpening its fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.46,0:25:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any way to escape those fangs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.13,0:25:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A howl resounds through the emptiness of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Wolf from Another Dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.47,0:25:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 317 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Only the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:53.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Has the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:14.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Memory only strikes at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:25.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The heart to find
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:37.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Do not forget it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:45.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Many stars lie beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:53.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The spiral of memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:24:06.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sparkling in what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:13.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}The light of memory
